#~ msgid ""
#~ "Important bird and biodiversity areas, which are sites that contribute "
#~ "significantly to the global persistence of biodiversity, identified using "
#~ "data on birds, of which >13,000 sites in total have been identified from all"
#~ " of the world’s countries;"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "مناطق الطيور والتنوع البيولوجي الهامة، وهي مواقع تساهم مساهمة كبيرة في "
